{"title":"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 40","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In order to draw a graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/d/71d13ac0e00358ad3fa8b0d6db3217b8a10cc7d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />, a table of values was constructed. These values of the function for a set of equally spaced increasing values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/f/70f9cf1d2bfc2ec1ea8f8f2b4b398932e8badac8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3844, 3969, 4096, 4227, 4356, 4489, 4624$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"302\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/a/65a7f2393760c3ef91bb3c259ccea3fe94f11dd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4761$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />. The one which is incorrect is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/d/33d5984f92a1997fb8dfc842823a787df97db505.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 4096 \\qquad \\text{(B) } 4356 \\qquad \\text{(C) } 4489 \\qquad \\text{(D) } 4761 \\qquad \\text{(E) } 4227$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"469\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the polynomial is quadratic, its second differences must be constant. Taking the first differences, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/5/7252ab6bad30d3f9dcaabced5b1432df07321319.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 3969-3844&amp;=125 \\\\ 4096-3969&amp;=127 \\\\ 4227-4096&amp;=131 \\\\ 4356-4227&amp;=129 \\\\ 4489-4356&amp;=133 \\\\ 4624-4489&amp;=135 \\\\ 4761-4624&amp;=137 \\end{align*}\" width=\"146\" height=\"162\" />\nThis leads to a common second difference of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, with the only discrepancy around the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/7225f7f823a14b87b9480bb497148756bd9bd48d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4227$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" />. Observe that if this point were instead <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/1/af1c3e9354fc9a4f64f93e3d042e8a3f31a0e527.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4225$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, the common second difference would, indeed be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for all data points. Therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/7225f7f823a14b87b9480bb497148756bd9bd48d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4227$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62effaf0d5dc9bfa1d137bed40c4baa73698962d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME\" title=\"1952 AHSME\">1952 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1952 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1952\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">Problem 39</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_41\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 41\">Problem 41</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</